      ]
    },
    "voiceover_S1_HOOK": {
      "object_id": "voiceover_S1_HOOK",
      "kind": "voiceover_audio",
      "local_path": "/home/ash/ai4ia-demo-pipeline/data/generated_assets/storyline_20260623_152606_validated/audio/sections/S1_HOOK_narration_broll_voiceover.mp3",
      "filename": "S1_HOOK_narration_broll_voiceover.mp3",
      "content_type": "audio/mpeg",
      "size_bytes": 227664,
      "created_at": "2026-06-23T09:59:35.844100",
      "section_id": "S1_HOOK",
      "voiceover_text": "Across the world, conversations about artificial intelligence are raising a central question: what does it mean for technology to serve people? But because AI is expected to display so many jobs and really bring a new way of working this is an important area for us in the Caribbean to make sure that we prepare our citizens for the changing demands of the digital era. The third principle about around resiliency and sustainability ensuring that the countries in our region can adapt to the AI revolution and here again we're looking at building that capacity around things like climate change and all of the knowledge that we have in the region around natural disasters."
    },
    "visual_S2_CONTEXT": {
      "object_id": "visual_S2_CONTEXT",
      "kind": "visual_asset",
      "local_path": "/home/ash/ai4ia-demo-pipeline/data/generated_assets/storyline_20260623_152606_validated/visuals/S2_CONTEXT_visual.png",
      "filename": "S2_CONTEXT_visual.png",
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "size_bytes": 227732,
      "created_at": "2026-06-23T10:00:00.042495",
      "section_id": "S2_CONTEXT",
      "visual_title": "Understanding the Issue",
      "visual_asset_type": "diagram",
      "visual_keywords": [
        "context",
        "definition",
        "scope",
        "concepts"
      ]
    },
    "voiceover_S2_CONTEXT": {
      "object_id": "voiceover_S2_CONTEXT",
      "kind": "voiceover_audio",
      "local_path": "/home/ash/ai4ia-demo-pipeline/data/generated_assets/storyline_20260623_152606_validated/audio/sections/S2_CONTEXT_narration_broll_voiceover.mp3",
      "filename": "S2_CONTEXT_narration_broll_voiceover.mp3",
      "content_type": "audio/mpeg",
      "size_bytes": 156960,
      "created_at": "2026-06-23T09:59:38.087138",
      "section_id": "S2_CONTEXT",
      "voiceover_text": "Across the AI4IA conversations, Change Climate is presented not as an abstraction, but as a challenge with concrete human consequences — for people who depend on these systems to work, and work fairly. But because AI is expected to display so many jobs and really bring a new way of working this is an important area for us in the Caribbean to make sure that we prepare our citizens for the changing demands of the digital era."
    },
    "visual_S3_EVIDENCE": {
      "object_id": "visual_S3_EVIDENCE",
      "kind": "visual_asset",
      "local_path": "/home/ash/ai4ia-demo-pipeline/data/generated_assets/storyline_20260623_152606_validated/visuals/S3_EVIDENCE_visual.png",
      "filename": "S3_EVIDENCE_visual.png",
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "size_bytes": 229487,
      "created_at": "2026-06-23T10:00:04.024558",
      "section_id": "S3_EVIDENCE",
      "visual_title": "Real-World Impact",
      "visual_asset_type": "risk_map",
      "visual_keywords": [
        "evidence",
        "impact",
        "communities",
        "data"
      ]
    },
    "voiceover_S3_EVIDENCE": {
      "object_id": "voiceover_S3_EVIDENCE",
      "kind": "voiceover_audio",
      "local_path": "/home/ash/ai4ia-demo-pipeline/data/generated_assets/storyline_20260623_152606_validated/audio/sections/S3_EVIDENCE_narration_broll_voiceover.mp3",
      "filename": "S3_EVIDENCE_narration_broll_voiceover.mp3",
      "content_type": "audio/mpeg",
      "size_bytes": 211824,
      "created_at": "2026-06-23T09:59:42.119204",
      "section_id": "S3_EVIDENCE",
      "voiceover_text": "But the arrival of AI in Change Climate does not resolve the underlying tensions. It often sharpens them — exposing who has voice, who has access, and who bears the risks. We are already seeing some collaboration among, let's say, the Caribbean, Caribbean entities. For example, the CTU, Caricom OS, but we need to enhance this. Countries like Israel are also using A. to simulate the impacts of climate change and water distribution, and develop adaptation and mitigation strategies."
    },
    "visual_S4_CHALLENGE": {
      "object_id": "visual_S4_CHALLENGE",
      "kind": "visual_asset",
      "local_path": "/home/ash/ai4ia-demo-pipeline/data/generated_assets/storyline_20260623_152606_validated/visuals/S4_CHALLENGE_visual.png",
      "filename": "S4_CHALLENGE_visual.png",
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "size_bytes": 221493,
      "created_at": "2026-06-23T10:00:08.189624",
      "section_id": "S4_CHALLENGE",
      "visual_title": "The Core Challenge",
      "visual_asset_type": "mindmap",
      "visual_keywords": [
        "challenge",
        "tension",
        "conflict",
        "complexity"
      ]
    },
    "voiceover_S4_CHALLENGE": {
      "object_id": "voiceover_S4_CHALLENGE",
      "kind": "voiceover_audio",
      "local_path": "/home/ash/ai4ia-demo-pipeline/data/generated_assets/storyline_20260623_152606_validated/audio/sections/S4_CHALLENGE_narration_broll_voiceover.mp3",
      "filename": "S4_CHALLENGE_narration_broll_voiceover.mp3",
      "content_type": "audio/mpeg",
      "size_bytes": 218016,
      "created_at": "2026-06-23T09:59:46.290272",
      "section_id": "S4_CHALLENGE",
      "voiceover_text": "Across these conversations, Change Climate is not a distant aspiration. It is a field in motion — with real evidence, real failure, and real possibilities for change. Google's deep mind is even predicting could the injuries 48 hours in advance. We're talking a life-saving magic here. As AI and data driven systems expand, people risk being reduced to mere data points, feeding distant algorithms. The future of human dependency, sorry, the future of human agency depends on shifting this dynamic."
    },
